<title>USA: TABLE - Culbro Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Culbro Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.39		    $0.73</p>
<p>Shr from continuing operations</p>
<p>				$0.98		    $0.57</p>
<p>Net from continuing operations</p>
<p>				4,767		    2,650</p>
<p> Net			  6,756		    3,377</p>
<p> Revs			58,908		   34,851</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,872		    4,669</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.86		    $0.93</p>
<p>Shr from continuing operations</p>
<p>		     $1.87		    $1.09</p>
<p>Net from continuing operations</p>
<p>			9,044		    5,045</p>
<p> Net		  9,020		    4,301</p>
<p> Revs		 108,706		  63,683</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   4,837		     4,646</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income includes the results of Griffin Land &amp; Nurseries Inc which was distributed to the shareholders in a tax-free spinoff.</p>
<p>Net income from continuing operations include the company's approximate 74 percent interest in its subsidiary General Cigar Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>Net income for the second quarter of 1996 includes $272,000 in income from CMS Gilbreth Packaging Systems Inc which was sold in November 1996.</p>
<p>Net income for the first six months of 1996 includes $768,000 in income from CMS Gilbreth.</p>
